eldon now serves as Artistic Associate of The Royal Ballet. As Artistic Associate, Mr. Wheeldon has created many works for the company, including the full-length Alice's Adventures in Wonderland and The Winter's Tale, both of which were co-productions with The National Ballet of Canada ... \",\"title\":\"https://newyork.mjthemusical.com/cast-creative/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d126\"},\"ref\":\"d126\",\"snippet\":\" ... Phoebe Waller-Bridge described her former co-star as \\\"completely brilliant... unbelievably charismatic in real life and so energetic\\\", \\\"Jonny operates at a different voltage. He's a meteorite of fun with an incredible amount of energy and playfulness.\\\" Director Marianne Elliott expressed that Bailey is \\\"the nicest ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonathan_Bailey\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d127\"},\"ref\":\"d127\",\"snippet\":\" ... The project was set up by York Theatre Royal, and involved its younger members (Youth Theatre) in the production.York Theatre Royal production. Yorktheatreroyal.co.uk. Retrieved on 18 June 2016.British Theatre Guide review. Britishtheatreguide.info. Retrieved on 18 June 2016. This adaptation then transferred for two ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Railway_Children\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d128\"},\"ref\":\"d128\",\"snippet\":\" ... She trained at Camberwell College of Arts, University of Brighton & The Royal College of Art and was an Artsadmin early career bursary recipient. She works with performers both professional and street cast, improvisation as much as scripts, and her work blends real life with the wildly imaginary.\\n\\nHer ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nyt.org.uk/news/new-news-article-17?url=%2Fnews%2Fnew-news-article-17%2F\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f6aa5f5149ce1e0213f17f691c8234d4c3cfc80578a488cadd6ab69bae9f1aa1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"4160c365641524e4f8c0adc71be5142295c0805d044ac0a91e60ed52d14532f3\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"The Royals E! series cast real life family members co-stars\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d129\"},\"ref\":\"d129\",\"snippet\":\" ... She was creative, too, and became the founding member of the Royal School of Needlework.\\n\\nHelena and her husband Christian are said to have had a very happy marriage together. Sadly, Christian died in 1917, shortly after their fiftieth wedding anniversary. Helena herself died six years later, on ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.natgeokids.com/uk/discover/history/monarchy/queen-victoria-children/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d130\"},\"ref\":\"d130\",\"snippet\":\" ... The star-crossed lovers are played by Mickey Mouse (Lysander), Minnie Mouse (Hermia), Donald Duck (Demetrius), and Daisy Duck (Helena). The character based on Theseus is played by Ludwig Von Drake, and the character based on Egeus by Scrooge McDuck. Goofy appears as an accident-prone Puck. The ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/A_Midsummer_Night%27s_Dream\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d131\"},\"ref\":